            "notes": "## Power\n\n[Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) gives us another [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512). That means more boops, and more healing output from [Crossfade](ability_3ea2d5de-0836-4fef-b232-e70f961c99da) (thanks to [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c)).\n\n---\n## Items\n\nPrioritize abilities that grant [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). We want more boops with [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512).",
