            "notes": "## Power\n\n- [Radio Edit](item_cd4b345d-19ff-4a91-917e-b133fe5ba4c2) gives us survivability. Every [Amp It Up](ability_ea72cca9-6348-4221-946c-a5d2c1714a42) gives us a (very) mini Sound Barrier. These mini Sound Barriers aren't powerful, but they can help push or save a life on retreat.\n\n- **If you have another power you like more**, go ahead and take it here. Radio Edit isn't necessary to the build, it's just what I like. \n\n- [Let's Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) may be a good alternative since we have so many [Soundwaves](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512).\n\n---\n## Items\n\nTake [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) to start applying debuffs with your [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512). Cybervenom is also nice because it has [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction)\n\nI mix in [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) starting this round, which is especially good to take if you have a Tracer, etc. or a Rein who charges away constantly.",
