            "notes": "## Items\n\nNow we take [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) to go with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). Boop your enemies to apply these debuffs. \n\nKeep in mind your first two powers are designed to heal your team using [Crossfade](ability_3ea2d5de-0836-4fef-b232-e70f961c99da), so don't peel off on your own.\n\nAgain, prioritize abilities with [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) to get more [Soundwaves](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512).",
