            "notes": "## Power \n\nOur Round 5 power is up to you. Know your play style. \n\n- I take [Megaphone](item_d995adf3-1789-4a16-b85c-21b8c14e4f7d) to increase our healing via [Amp It Up](ability_ea72cca9-6348-4221-946c-a5d2c1714a42). Since we're supposed to be with the team/on the payload, this helps us keep the group healed. \n- If there's a power you like more, go ahead and grab it here. Megaphone doesn't necessary synergize with anything\u2014it's just good soup. \n- [Let's Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) or [Radio Edit](item_cd4b345d-19ff-4a91-917e-b133fe5ba4c2) may be good alternatives if you haven't taken them yet.\n\n---\n## Items\n\n- [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) give us [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). \n- [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) gives us more debuff (in addition to what Cybervenom gives us). \n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) gives us more ability healing and damage.\n\n---\n## Competitive Build?\n\nYou can probably extend this build to Comp by adding Let's Bounce as your Round 7 power. If you took Let's Bounce earlier, then choose Megaphone or Radio Edit as your Round 7 power (whichever you did not choose).",
